# 别人在文章 / 课程 / 报告里引用这个工具时，GitHub 会从这个文件生成 BibTeX 和 APA。
# 不强制 —— 只是把「怎么引用」写清楚，省得各人自己编一种格式。
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference vramfit in an article, course or internal report, cite it like this."
title: "vramfit"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free command-line and web tool that reads only the GGUF header and
  estimates whether a local model fits the available VRAM (including Apple unified
  memory), how much context it can hold, and whether its chat template can drive a
  coding agent. Estimates are static, not benchmarks.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "RoRoToCode"
    website: "https://www.roroto.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RoRoToCode/vramfit"
url: "https://www.roroto.com/vramfit"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-06"
keywords:
  - gguf
  - vram
  - local-llm
  - llama.cpp
  - apple-silicon
  - quantization
  - coding-agent
